====Usage notes====
* {{ISO 3166/inr||designating road vehicles under the 1949 {{w|Geneva Convention on Road Traffic}}|{{w|Haiti}}|HT}}
* Despite the existence of the ''de facto'' state of {{w|Rhodesia}} upon the publication of {{w|ISO 3166}} in 1974, its lack of recognition by the {{w|United Nations}} meant that the code instead referred to the ''de jure'' British colony of {{w|Southern Rhodesia}}. The code was, however, deprecated in favour of {{l|mul|ZW}} upon the country's establishment as {{w|Zimbabwe}}, which did gain international recognition.

